Eifo is written and maintained by Barak Bloch. Everyone who has contributed to it
is listed below, in the order their first change landed.

Copyright stays with each contributor. The MIT licence in LICENSE covers every
line in this repository, and opening a pull request means you are content for
your work to ship under it - there is no CLA to sign and nothing to post.

Adding yourself is the last commit of your first pull request: your name, plus
whichever of a handle, a profile or an email address you would rather be reached
at. The listing below is the credit; nothing else is asked of you.

Note that this file, and the licence it points at, cover the code alone. None of
the catalog data, artwork or ratings the software retrieves belongs to anyone
here - see "Data, attribution and fair use" in README.md.


